NAME
     pause - stop until signal

SYNOPSIS
     pause()

DESCRIPTION
     _P_a_u_s_e never returns normally.  It is used to give up control
     while waiting for a signal from _k_i_l_l(2) or _a_l_a_r_m(2).

ERRORS
     _P_a_u_s_e always returns:

     [EINTR]             The call was interrupted.

SEE ALSO
     kill(1), kill(2), alarm(2), signal(2), setjmp(3)

ASSEMBLER
     (pause = 29.)
     sys pause

